{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_095bacad848204c4350d642916208f241e501dfd657705467a90ed59b8500359"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The documentation warns that orchestration mode spawns headless AI agents that run with full permissions and can incur significant cost."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5fe13e564fac56548fb95e11f15250fa0c114e1fee368ddd63877e69fa36a9ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Orchestration mode is a multi-agent control plane where a coordinator headless agent spawns, replaces, and retires worker agents via built-in MCP tools, with multiple workflows run in parallel."},{"claim_ids":["clm_68f82f927b6499f0b63334cf5fb9d06e259ebd2f9fadd0c9a207804df49b0bc9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Orchestration providers include Claude, Amp, Codex, OpenCode, and Cursor Agent CLI; coordinator and worker clients can be mixed, e.g. cursor coordinator with claude workers."}],"claim_ids":["clm_095bacad848204c4350d642916208f241e501dfd657705467a90ed59b8500359","clm_5fe13e564fac56548fb95e11f15250fa0c114e1fee368ddd63877e69fa36a9ba","clm_68f82f927b6499f0b63334cf5fb9d06e259ebd2f9fadd0c9a207804df49b0bc9"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","id":"pg_39b7b117819e562e9c277bed808929c4","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/zjrosen-perles-orchestration-md-f97afa7a7c44-7bed808929c4.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_be142816e72d5667b391d6e6d023ac82"],"title":"zjrosen/perles/ORCHESTRATION.md @ f97afa7a7c44","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_4e82b99eea7f379e5d9b27ddbbea96abd6a3007ce00b429e1f9fb3518851c1fc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: optional Cursor integration tests are build-tagged, run via go test -tags=cursor_integration, and are intended for local/dev environments rather than CI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_503e285b1c2946cadebdc933aec798870296aca511fa21ad49d1fd537a77bbe9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Since Cursor lacks --append-system-prompt, Perles prepends the system prompt to the main prompt with a blank line separator, the same approach used for OpenCode."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5487d2c58aa59d90888259336c8f2d28a0b823d8d2dc14049b98e1503155f97a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cursor CLI does not support tool filtering flags, so all agent tools remain enabled and the DisallowedTools config field is silently ignored for that provider."},{"claim_ids":["clm_68f82f927b6499f0b63334cf5fb9d06e259ebd2f9fadd0c9a207804df49b0bc9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Orchestration providers include Claude, Amp, Codex, OpenCode, and Cursor Agent CLI; coordinator and worker clients can be mixed, e.g. cursor coordinator with claude workers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_76bf15a24d7e2c3d90352a377fd0f0cea1008b57ecc7460d6f62587266ad3307"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Using the Cursor provider requires the cursor-agent CLI on PATH; installing from source requires Go 1.27+."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ae865c03813fb4c44446b647af734672451ce92b2e72db0cc8bcf004ed8d52ac"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"With the Cursor provider, token and cost fields show zero because Cursor's stream-json output lacks usage and cost data."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ca60a241d71e0e380f83af37ead67cdb5acd88eb87175b101011a3f1d88c8516"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Because Cursor reads MCP config only from .cursor/mcp.json, Perles writes role-specific server entries (orchestrator, per-worker, observer) into that shared file using a read-merge-write pattern."}],"claim_ids":["clm_4e82b99eea7f379e5d9b27ddbbea96abd6a3007ce00b429e1f9fb3518851c1fc","clm_503e285b1c2946cadebdc933aec798870296aca511fa21ad49d1fd537a77bbe9","clm_5487d2c58aa59d90888259336c8f2d28a0b823d8d2dc14049b98e1503155f97a","clm_68f82f927b6499f0b63334cf5fb9d06e259ebd2f9fadd0c9a207804df49b0bc9","clm_76bf15a24d7e2c3d90352a377fd0f0cea1008b57ecc7460d6f62587266ad3307","clm_ae865c03813fb4c44446b647af734672451ce92b2e72db0cc8bcf004ed8d52ac","clm_ca60a241d71e0e380f83af37ead67cdb5acd88eb87175b101011a3f1d88c8516"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac","id":"pg_3a11a7c766675b10a861fde4f5ea2503","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/zjrosen-perles-docs-cursor-agent-md-f97afa7a7c44-fde4f5ea2503.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c66a465232cd5868b16aae0fcc6fbce3"],"title":"zjrosen/perles/docs/CURSOR_AGENT.md @ f97afa7a7c44","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:34:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1afee7b0543d40c39af07e5c5c4120ac"}
